sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as model-registry-operator<br/>opendatahub namespace
    participant APIClient as API Client CLI<br/>api-client/run.py
    participant ExtAPI as External Benchmark<br/>REST API
    participant DataDir as Local Data Directory
    participant Registry as Container Registry
    participant InitContainer as Init Container
    participant ModelCatalog as model-catalog Deployment<br/>odh-model-registries namespace

    Note over APIClient: Data Ingestion Pipeline (Build Time)

    APIClient->>ExtAPI: GET /api/v1/providers<br/>HTTPS, configurable TLS verify
    ExtAPI-->>APIClient: Provider records (paginated)

    APIClient->>ExtAPI: GET /api/v1/models<br/>HTTPS
    ExtAPI-->>APIClient: Model records (paginated)

    APIClient->>ExtAPI: GET /api/v1/evaluations<br/>HTTPS
    ExtAPI-->>APIClient: Evaluation records (paginated)

    APIClient->>ExtAPI: GET /api/v1/performances<br/>HTTPS
    ExtAPI-->>APIClient: Performance records (paginated)

    APIClient->>ExtAPI: GET /api/v1/validations<br/>HTTPS
    ExtAPI-->>APIClient: Validation records (paginated)

    APIClient->>ExtAPI: GET /api/v1/variant-groups<br/>HTTPS
    ExtAPI-->>APIClient: Variant group records (paginated)

    APIClient->>ExtAPI: GET /api/v1/security<br/>HTTPS
    ExtAPI-->>APIClient: Security evaluation records (paginated)

    Note over APIClient: Serialize: timestamps → epoch-ms,<br/>fields normalized

    Note over APIClient: Deduplicate by record ID

    Note over APIClient: Post-process: accuracy computation,<br/>hardware configs, vLLM commands,<br/>modelcar image sizes

    APIClient->>DataDir: Write NDJSON per model<br/>(evaluations, performance,<br/>security-evaluations)
    APIClient->>DataDir: Write JSON per model<br/>(metadata, provider info)
    APIClient->>DataDir: Generate manifest.json

    Note over DataDir,Registry: Container Image Build

    DataDir->>Registry: Package data as<br/>container image

    Note over Operator,ModelCatalog: Runtime Deployment

    Operator->>ModelCatalog: Manages deployment lifecycle
    Registry->>InitContainer: Pull init container image
    InitContainer->>ModelCatalog: Mount data directory<br/>into model-catalog pod
